; LOC-12 (M3-8R). The approved M3-8A pieces are authored in resources/campaign/rooms/LOC-12.json ("assembly": "exterior_kit");
; PiecePreload makes their GLBs (both LODs) and VH_Rover_Lit dependencies of this scene, so a threaded room load
; decodes them off the main thread before the room is built.
[node name="MalapertSummit" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_room")
room_id = "LOC-12"

